 eathing (in for 4\, out for 6). A consistent wind-down cue helps your brai
 n recognise bedtime.\n\nAim for the same bedtime and wake time\, even on w
 eekends. That's one of the best-supported sleep habits.\n\n—\nFrom Sleep
 ward: Bedtime Routine\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/a
